        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Elysium Elect!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[<strong>Elysium Elect</strong>] is an intense climbing adventure set within an endless dream. Your goal is simple yet daunting: ascend continuously to break free from the nightmare's grip and uncover the secrets of the slumbering world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This journey is the ultimate test of your skill and resolve. You will traverse a series of ever-shifting, surreal dreamscapes—from deep mines and collapsing ruins to intricate spatial mazes and magical realms. Along the way, you must execute precise jumps across floating platforms, deftly evade deadly traps, and utilize the dreamworld's strange mechanisms to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you push forward, the challenges intensify. You will face increasingly surreal trials: finding your balance on dizzying illusionary bridges, making critical choices at forks in the road, and ultimately mustering the courage for a decisive leap of faith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each successful ascent unlocks a new, more breathtaking and bizarre domain. This epic voyage across the boundaries of imagination awaits your first step.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Elysium Elect!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[<strong>Elysium Elect</strong>] is an intense climbing adventure set within an endless dream. Your goal is simple yet daunting: ascend continuously to break free from the nightmare's grip and uncover the secrets of the slumbering world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This journey is the ultimate test of your skill and resolve. You will traverse a series of ever-shifting, surreal dreamscapes—from deep mines and collapsing ruins to intricate spatial mazes and magical realms. Along the way, you must execute precise jumps across floating platforms, deftly evade deadly traps, and utilize the dreamworld's strange mechanisms to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you push forward, the challenges intensify. You will face increasingly surreal trials: finding your balance on dizzying illusionary bridges, making critical choices at forks in the road, and ultimately mustering the courage for a decisive leap of faith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each successful ascent unlocks a new, more breathtaking and bizarre domain. This epic voyage across the boundaries of imagination awaits your first step.</p>",
        "short_description": "Can you conquer your inner fears and reach the dream's summit? Elysium Elect is a challenging 3D platformer where you explore profound dreams, navigate through surreal worlds with precise jumps, and uncover the secrets hidden within.",
